00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.100
Ben Franklin.

176
00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:35.760
You might know him as the guy on the $100 bill or the inventor of the lightning rod or the bifocal lenses.

177
00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:44.440
Or maybe you know that he is the only founding father to sign all four documents credited with creating the United States of America.

178
00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:49.700
That includes the Declaration of Independence, the Treaty of Paris, and the Constitution.

179
00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:55.060
But here are some other interesting facts about Benjamin Franklin.

180
00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:55.620
What?

181
00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.360
He had 16 siblings.

182
00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.640
His poor mother.

183
00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.100
His mother was pregnant her whole life.

184
00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:03.500
Her whole life she was pregnant.

185
00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:06.300
My grandfather was one of 11.

186
00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:11.080
He was like the third to last born, and his mom named him Pliny.

187
00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:11.820
Oh, no.

188
00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.680
And in my family, we've always been like, what?

189
00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.860
Did that mean she was just like, I need a break?

190
00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:16.860
Hey, that's Pliny.

191
00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.520
Take a pause.

192
