They could have named him Enough or Finished.

193
00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:24.400
Stay off me.

194
00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.540
Yeah, get away.

195
00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:26.840
This is my kid.

196
00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:27.280
Get away.

