00:20:51.590 --> 00:21:02.570
So he is instituting Prima Nocta, which Jim then explains in his talking head is something

475
00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:09.450
from the movie Braveheart, where the king is allowed to deflower every new bride on her

476
00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:09.990
